     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">Hi Ali,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">Your model seems not to be identified. Try to use the CFA or SEM functions, they are the same, instead of the lavaan one. These functions are wrappers to the lavaan function and take care of a lot of identification issues with the auto vars... See the help for details.</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><a href=\"https://www.rdocumentation.org/packages/lavaan/versions/0.6-5/topics/cfa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.rdocumentation.org/packages/lavaan/versions/0.6-5/topics/cfa&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792421953726000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0WUIwBcZg9W8SeH1PwZjgF\">https://www.rdocumentation.org/packages/lavaan/versions/0.6-5/topics/cfa</a>  <br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><a href=\"https://www.rdocumentation.org/packages/lavaan/versions/0.6-5/topics/lavOptions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.rdocumentation.org/packages/lavaan/versions/0.6-5/topics/lavOptions&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792421953726000&amp;usg=AOvVaw37f__iF0zgHzyTp4_uSMcJ\">https://www.rdocumentation.org/packages/lavaan/versions/0.6-5/topics/lavOptions</a>  <br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">Hope this helps.</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">Hugs from Hugo</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
