     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Looks like this is the same issue you posted on GitHub:  <a href=\"https://github.com/r-lib/tidyselect/issues/191\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/r-lib/tidyselect/issues/191&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792421953727000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ADL142lXWfSx7C2iX5PvG\">https://github.com/r-lib/tidyselect/issues/191</a><div><br></div><div>Try passing a <font face=\"courier new, monospace\">data.frame</font> to lavaan instead of a &quot;<font face=\"courier new, monospace\">tbl</font>&quot; object (use<font face=\"courier new, monospace\"> as.data.frame() </font>to convert it), or you can install the development version of lavaan, which will now do the conversion for you.</div><div><br></div><div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">install</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">packages</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;lavaan&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> repos </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;<a href=\"http://www.da.ugent.be\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.da.ugent.be&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792421953727000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0KAGElK9nEj3Kzmr57Otv8\">http://www.da.ugent.be</a>&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> type </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;source&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br></div></div></div>"
